{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Increase the Motability mileage allowance from 10,000 to 15,000 miles per year",
        "additional_details": "Increase the Motability mileage allowance above 10,000 miles a year. Mobility is about more than hospital appointments, work and school runs. Customers need to visit family, including those living 200+ miles away, maintain relationships, access support and protect their mental and physical wellbeing. People should also be able to drive outside their town for fresh air, a change of scenery or breathing space without constantly worrying about running out of miles.",
        "background": "Increase the Motability mileage allowance above 10,000 miles. Mobility is about more than medical appointments and school runs. People need to visit family, including those 200+ miles away, and travel for mental wellbeing, breathing space, independence and quality of life.",
